For Sentinel-to-Defender-XDR migration, XDR Detection authoring, hybrid
packaging, or AR/CD qualification, read and follow
`Tools/SentinelToXDRMigration/agent-workflows/end-to-end-migration.md`.

That document is canonical. Use repository CLIs for deterministic behavior,
default to the authoring profile, and ask before optional qualification.
Qualification deployment, mock ingestion, and parity are not publishing
requirements. Use V3.1 through `package-v3-1` for Sentinel and XDR solution
packages. Resume persisted workflow state and require approval before writes.
